> [Our] Chalets and Log Cabins are set in their own beautifully landscaped woodland grounds in Blairgowrie, the heart of the Perthshire Highlands. This private park is only 5 minutes’ walk from the town centre and provides a perfect destination for your holiday break. Explore the great outdoors with a wealth of golfing, fishing, skiing, walking and cycling opportunities in and around the local area.
Our site is always being updated with news and offers, so please check back regularly. In the meantime if you want to get in touch you can email[ us] by clicking[ here], or call us on 01250 872464.[][][][][][][][][][][][][][][]

=== Text #13 ===
> [How does the] TennisTampa[Bay] Tourney Work[?]
The TennisTampa[Bay] staff will seed 25% of the participants based veteran status (Most number of matches played in their[ career]) with the program. If we have 8 players enrolled we'll seed the top 2 players, 16 players the top 4 players. The rest of the players will be randomly entered into the draw.
We will run a consolation bracket for the players who lost their first match. Seedings for the consolation bracket will be randomly selected by[ the] TennisTampa[Bay] staff. The winner of the consolation bracket will receive at least a $25 Tennis Warehouse Gift Card. Matches need to be played to crown a consolation bracket winner.[][]

